#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:5
#: 27b3aac5c4694de0a267c27ac4601738 2c32f80f65dc40bb8dbbb060123f6c1c
#: 67a9a1cd1e4149f98a9906e3f1c33795 a51c0fe971094976b572af16511f24ca
#: a87aa53fcefd4cdbb474793dcf7bdb29 d3d739d9df334813977758f62105a352
msgid "CUAV X7 Family Overview"
msgstr "CUAV X7 系列概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:11
#: 0a9916f41e554bb49fa7acd81b4646a2 24cd3cfe68f147bf815b5f8f5af3bdfe
#: 2e3a1e360ac045458a18c8e74af7c011 6a116204cf4945e8bb14decec9215068
#: 701fd09899bc4929bae29cb5cba46deb e277919268084dbabfa918a07c287f40
msgid ""
"**X7/X7 Pro/X7+/X7+ Pro®** is an advanced autopilot family designed in-house"
" by CUAV®. It uses a higher-performance STM32H7 processor and integrates "
"industrial-grade sensors. Compared with previous autopilots, it has better "
"performance and higher reliability."
msgstr ""
"**X7/X7 Pro/X7+/X7+ Pro®** 是由 CUAV® 自主设计的先进飞控系列。采用性能更高的 STM32H7 "
"处理器，集成了工业级传感器。与以前的飞控相比，性能更好，可靠性更高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:13
#: 59f9248a89524de8a67732ba30dff8fa 66e2ff449f7e42da8aad7a4ebbd6d163
#: a9799867c2704ccdbf58cafd05f03e95 bd83d62ae44742ef942a10ba82716384
#: e4ffe49626d64fb1ad176e75e2e10a87 fd58fd43865f4fe4a52101e020a10ede
msgid ""
"The first generation autopilots (X7/X7 Pro) have been updated with new "
"sensors, providing the same high performance, but with more reliable source "
"of supply, and some improvements to allow Bi-dir DShot and servo rail "
"voltage monitoring."
msgstr ""
"第一代飞控（X7/X7 Pro）已更新新型传感器，保持同等高性能的同时，货源更稳定，并有所改进以支持双向 DShot 和舵机供电轨电压监控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:15
#: 28e06e7738404beca89f05310e691912 2c4b0e8c5e72487fa8bf8f86cb90216f
#: 6ef40aa266304ca096c5627dfea6bdeb 87597f3ddcb24dae8db852cb442639b9
#: c88b890b8a0840eb816c081d5ebfa83c d9403c84ef8249d1bc24e9fc35d925d5
msgid ""
"The modular design allows users to customize the baseboard and is fully "
"compatible with the CUAV V5+ carrier board. The X7+/X7+ Pro are ideal for "
"academic research and commercial systems integration."
msgstr "模块化设计允许用户自定义底板，与 CUAV V5+ 底板完全兼容。X7+/X7+ Pro 非常适合学术研究和商业系统集成。"

